pret — https://github.com/pret/pokeemerald , https://github.com/pret/pokefirered
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The authoritative Gen-3 link protocol (include/link.h, src/link.c, src/trade.c)
that validated the wire format, the LINKCMD_*/LINKTYPE_* tables, and the
idle-frame / RECEIVED_NOTHING semantics 3DGBA relies on.

