mGBA — https://github.com/mgba-emu/mgba
License: Mozilla Public License 2.0 (file-level copyleft)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

3DGBA embeds mGBA as its Game Boy Advance core. mGBA files remain under MPL-2.0;
3DGBA's wireless link is a new GBASIODriver peripheral, not a fork of mGBA's
lockstep driver. Any modified mGBA files remain MPL-2.0 and source-available.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Voxel overworld (source/voxel/)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The 3D overworld renderer in source/voxel/ is vendored from ZallaxDev/pokeemerald-3Ds-dualscreen
(commit c330c0a, MIT), which itself reuses logic from gradenGnostic/pokeemerald-multiplatform
(commit db1cab3d, MIT). Files are modified for 3DGBA and carry a header saying so. The pret
decompilation is not included; game data (emerald3ds.pak) is never shipped. Upstream's tree PNGs
(assets/voxel/trees/) are Emerald's own tree graphics, which upstream's MIT grant excludes, so
3DGBA does not ship them: builds embed a local copy only when one is present. Both notices follow in full.

